WEBVTT

00:01:28.453 --> 00:01:31.721
She kept it on her body
and she swam with it.

00:01:31.745 --> 00:01:35.878
If it did fall off,
she would dive and rescue it,

00:01:35.902 --> 00:01:38.782
and she battled stiff currents to do this.

00:01:39.218 --> 00:01:41.371
Now, she kept this behavior up

00:01:41.395 --> 00:01:44.092
for 17 days,

00:01:44.116 --> 00:01:47.494
and during this time,
she swam over 1,000 miles.

00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:51.964
At that point, she let the little baby
slip off into the water.

00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:57.255
So today, Tahlequah
swims on with the J Pod,

00:01:57.279 --> 00:02:00.573
but her grief still moves me.